window.products.push({"id":799042,"name":"Gingko Flip Click Clock LED Alarm Clock Sound Activated with New Flip Technology, Rechargeable with Laser Engraved Touch Controls, Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OTORF9AUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural materials, Intelligent technology, Fine details.? The brand new Gingko Flip Click Clock is the 2nd generation from our 6 years best-selling click clock collection and it has kept the same sharp and clean lines design concept as our cube click clocks. The Flip Click Clock is now crafted with natural wood material (Cherry, Walnut, Ash and White Maple) and incorporated with our popular sound activated LED clock system , laser engraved touch control top and the new flip alarm technology. It’s designed to enhance your whole experience of day to day alarm clock use. The technologies built into the Flip Click Clock changes your normal way of using an alarm clock. When the Gingko Logo shows on top it means the alarm is off and when the nicely engraved alarm icon shows on top instead it means the alarm is turned on. With the same sound activated clock system as our other click clocks, the clock display automatically disappears when it’s quiet but still moves perfectly accurate every second. It lights up again when you give a gentle touch, or a cheerful clap, or a magical click of your fingers. The Flip Click Clock only tells you the time (12 or 24 hour format) instead of alternating between date and temperature. However, this simplified display function has made it super-easy to set up. To set the time and alarm, simply touch the fine laser engraved buttons. When the alarm goes off, gently ‘stroke’ any of these engraved buttons on the top to snooze and to turn off the alarm, you can easily flip it over and the numbers will be magically corrected to a normal display as well, keeping the same time and moving as accurate as before.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OTORF9AUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gingko","source_asin":"B07KKFDRL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KKFDRL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KKFDRL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":799043,"name":"Super Soft, Large Opening 14 Inch 2 Pack Christmas Stockings for Pet Dog and Cat. With Sturdy Hooks and Lining for Hanging by Mantel or Fireplace. Cut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SdPgsLIsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wide opening, extra soft holiday stocking fits all the presents you want to give to your Good Dog and Good Cat!This super soft, durable stocking with large opening will ensure no fur baby is ever left behind. We know how much you love your little friends, so we provide the perfect sized stocking to stuff their gifts in! Our deluxe stockings when filled with their favorite delights and presents will light up your home and make their holiday even better! Made from superior quality fabric, the stocking will retain its shape even when empty!Is the material safe for animals?Yes, made from 100% polyester, it is completely safe and will not cause any allergy or side effects. The soft material won't scratch or damage your mantel or fireplace, unlike scratchy burlap stockings. Keep it by the hearth and mantel decorations and ornaments or hang them by the tree or on walls and complete your family picture!What stocking stuffers can be used?Toys, snacks, candy, big treats, gifts, packaged food and all your love - you can put in anything that your four legged friends love for their christmas-stockings surprise from Santa! All you have to worry about as Pawrents is choosing the perfect present for your beloved babies!Is it reusable?Yes, the stocking is reusable. Purchase it once and keep it for a lifetime. It can be easily washed, cleaned and stored for your fur babies. Take them out next holiday and it'll look as bright as new!What’s in the box?Each box set contains one Good Dog and one Good Cat stocking of size (8.5 in) length and (14 in) height each, designed in Christmas colors for unlimited fun!Lifetime 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee!If you aren’t completely satisfied with your order, simply email us, and we will respond within 24 hours to make it right even on the weekends. We absolutely guarantee your satisfaction or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SdPgsLIsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EUCATUS BEST PRODUCTS & GIFTS","source_asin":"B09M79CCNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M79CCNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M79CCNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
