window.products.push({"id":799059,"name":"Aluminum Pizza Peel 12 Inch & 10 Inch Set with 2-in-1 Pizza Cutter Wheel Metal Spatula - Pizza Paddle with Folding Handle for Easy Storage - 3-Piece P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71juGoT2nYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Aluminum Pizza Peel with Foldable Handle was made for the pizza maker, home chef, and bread maker, camp chef accessories. Bread maker paddle Designed with function and practicality in mind, the stainless steel metal is made from finest grade materials for durability and high temperatures. With 10-inch & 12-inch foldable handle, it can easily be folded inward to save space. The Pizza peel set is suitable for any kitchen, gourmet pizza parlor and bakery. Its resistance materials prevents heat from transferring pizza and baked goods to and from an oven/grill. How to Use Pizza Peel to transfer pizzas, bread and other baked goods to and from the oven, outdoor grill and wood fired ovens 1. Turn the Pizza Peel handle upward.  2. Spread flour, cornmeal or milled wheat bran to allow the pizza, bread and baked goods to go easily onto the peel. 3. place onto a pizza stone, baking sheet or tray with the peel. 4. Once finished cooking, slide out the pizza, bread or baked goods from the oven using the peel.  5. Enjoy and serve! Materials: Metal Peel: stainless steel. pizza cutter and spatula: stainless steel. Measurement: Pizza turning Peel: 10-inch. Pizza Dough Peel: 12-inch. huge pizza cutter and spatula baking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71juGoT2nYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fox001","source_asin":"B08SJHHMKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJHHMKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJHHMKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
