window.products.push({"id":799186,"name":"Horseshoe Bend Dusk by Mike Jones Photo, 24x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lalp9o+LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a horseshoe shaped pond in the center of the frame. Mike's love of photography started at age 10 when his father taught him how to use his old Pentax SLR camera. By the time he graduated high school, he had also graduated from his 35mm Pentax, to an old 4x5 Graflex camera. From the beginning, landscapes were his true passion. During Summer vacations in Maine, Mike would choose to climb around the rocky shore with a camera and tripod instead of shopping with his family in downtown Bar Harbor. He soon landed a job shooting photos for a local newspaper where he continued to work while studying photography in college. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lalp9o+LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B075T5S91F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075T5S91F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075T5S91F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":799187,"name":"Vasofe Super Soft Black Fluffy Runner Rug 2x6 Shag Bedroom Rug, Fuzzy Living Room Rug for Kids, Plush Nursery Rug for Dorm, Classroom, Teen, Shaggy Fu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713pX68QCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vasofe super soft area rugs for your home! Introducing our soft and fluffy area rug, made with high-quality materials that will provide you with the ultimate comfort and luxury in your home. Our soft shag rug is made of super soft velvet fur, measures approximately 1.7 inches high, giving you a plush feel under your feet. Your best choice for a rug Invest in our luxurious plush area rug for a cozy and stylish home. Its soft, furry, and comfortable texture will make it a favorite spot for your family and guests to relax, while its durable construction and easy maintenance will ensure it lasts for years to come. With its affordable price and versatile design, it's a must-have addition to any home. Comfortable and useful Our versatile rug design is perfect for any home decor and furniture. With a solid color pattern and sizes of 2x6 feet, 4x6 feet, 5x7 feet available, it can easily blend in with any room in your home. Its thousands of PVC dots on the bottom also provide a non-slip backing, making it perfect for wooden or other types of floors, and creating a cozy atmosphere in your reading room or classroom. Easy to care Simply use a damp cloth and mild soap or use a vacuum cleaner to remove dust and dirt. With high-quality materials that are durable and long-lasting, making this soft shag rug perfect for families with kids and pets. Plus, it's made with animal-friendly materials, so you can enjoy its softness and beauty without any guilt. Warm tips Hope you enjoy your rug for years to come, so we have some warm tips to share. 1.our rug is vacuum-packed for easy transportation and storage. Upon arrival, it may appear slightly thinner than its original form, but it will be restored to its full shape within 3-5 days.  2.Please handle the rug with care, as it may be susceptible to scratches or burns from cigarette butts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713pX68QCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vasofe","source_asin":"B0BY6DJYCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY6DJYCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY6DJYCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
