window.products.push({"id":799259,"name":"ARDOUR VAN BIJA + CO Reusable Produce Bag | 100% Natural Cotton Muslin & Mesh Bags | Tare Weight on Label | Eco-Friendly | Machine Washable | 7 Piece ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B+0+4iU7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Hello, we are BIJA + CO! A small family owned business that believes small changes can make a BIG difference. Our goal is to create practical and sustainable products that are beneficial for you & the environment. By providing an eco-conscious solution to help reduce waste, we hope to make life simpler & more enjoyable for you and your family. After all, life shouldn’t be that complicated! Our reusable eco bag set comes with: 🍃3 Cotton Muslin S – 8 x 10” M – 10 x 12” L – 12 x 15” 🍃3 Cotton Mesh S – 8 x 10” M – 10 x 12” L – 12 x 15” 🍃1 Bonus Carry Pouch Stores all your bags in one place. Works great for your personal belongings too! Enjoy the perks of going green with our premium BIJA bags! Here’s why: 🍃Multi-purpose & versatile. Cotton mesh is best suited for fresh produce such as veggies, carrots, herbs, fruits etc. Cotton muslin bags for bulk food like grains, nuts, bread & dry food products. They also make great lunch sacks, travel accessory bags & are perfect for other storage needs in your home. 🍃Refrigerator friendly. Use these bags to store your produce in the fridge to keep them fresh. 🍃Not your average produce bag. A fresh pop of green on the drawstring cord & label, now you can shop in style. Who says grocery shopping is boring! 🍃No unnecessary hardware. No more clanky sounds during washing. No more added weight during check-out. Convenient drawstring closure for easy access. 🍃Made to last. Our BIJA bags are made using heavier weight & tighter knit cotton for durability. Quality seam work withstands heavy loads & ensures no fraying after washing. 🍃Easy care. They are machine washable in cold water, normal wash cycle, no bleach, line dry. With proper care, these bags will last a lifetime! Purchase your BIJA bags w/confidence today because we care for a BETTER FUTURE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B+0+4iU7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honbeanify","source_asin":"B07CT18MB9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CT18MB9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CT18MB9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":799260,"name":"Extra Large Lemon Squeezer Stainless Steel - Easy Squeeze Heavy Duty Manual Lemon Juicer with Non-slip Silicone Handle - Ergonomic Citrus Squeezer & F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z5zx+j97L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfort & Easy to Clean - Thanks to the heavy duty construction and ergonomic design, it squeezes fruit quick and effortlessly. And the polished finish makes it’s easy to wash, no smudges or stickies, just make sure to rinse after every use. Dishwasher safe. Juices Every Drop - To use, place half of a lemon in the squeezer with the cut side facing down. This allows the juice to drain directly out of the holes. Squeezing the handles together inverts the lemon peel, guaranteeing that the maximum volume of juice is produced. 13 holes design gives you more juice by extracting every last drop of juice from your fruits. Usability & Large Capacity - Size 8.65 x 3.22 x 2.1 inch (22.5 x 8.2 x 5.5cm). You can use it on large lemons and medium size oranges with a diameter of 2.75 inches. Note: if you mainly squeeze small limes, we advise you to choose the juicer with small bowl. Anti Slip & Easy to Clean - This lemon manual juicers comes with the anti slip silicone cover. Thanks to the heavy duty construction and ergonomic design, it squeezes fruit quick and effortlessly and won't slip. And the polished finish makes it’s easy to wash, no smudges or stickies, just make sure to rinse after every use. Dishwasher safe. Citrus Squeezer - If you regularly use a squeezer for juicing a variety of citrus fruits, owning the Dxlac Kitchen Lemon Squeezer diameter close to 3.22 inch is a healthy investment that you’ll surely be thankful for. Made with top-grade 304 stainless steel, the perfect metal composition for excellent corrosion resistance, and no rusting in reaction to acidic juices. Works well with lemons, limes, and small grapefruits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z5zx+j97L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dxlac","source_asin":"B09WZZDS6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WZZDS6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WZZDS6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
