window.products.push({"id":799410,"name":"Cutting Board - 16x12 Inches Large Wood Cutting Board - Oak Cutting Board with Juice Groove - Steak Board - Fruit Cutting Board - Real Wood Cutting Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OGuZk2qZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kitchen cutting board is made out of an edge grain oak.Cutting wood board is 16 inches (356 mm) by 12 inches (305 mm).Large cutting board thickness is 0.8 inches (20 mm).While plastic chopping board with groove might seem like a good choice, cutting boards wood has a few undeniable benefits to it. Great aesthetics, general food safety, as well as being gentle to knives to name a few.Between different wooden cutting boards, there is one cutting board for kitchen wood type that is famed for its properties - it's an oak. Oak cutting boards for kitchen are well-known for their durability, longevity and density.Being wooden cutting board with juice groove, it makes this kitchen wood board great for meat, fruit and vegetables. Cutting board with grooves for meat is also an awesome steak cutting board when needed.Wood cutting boards for kitchen are also well-suited to be used as wood serving boards in case you need one. And this large oak cutting board is no exception. This is a thin cutting board so it doesn't weight as much. You can put quite a lot on this large chopping board.This wood chopping board will become the staple of your kitchen. Oak chopping board is versatile, durable and a pleasure to use every day for all sorts of things.How to care about this chopping board wood:Never put this cutting board for kitchen in a dishwasher.Only wash cutting wooden board in warm soapy water.Use paper towels to dry circular wood board or let it air dry.Do not lay wooden chopping board flat when wet.Regularly apply mineral oil to the cutting board wood to extend the life of a cutting board.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OGuZk2qZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rightitem","source_asin":"B09JCD6TNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JCD6TNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JCD6TNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
