window.products.push({"id":799610,"name":"Cutting Board Set of 3, Double-Side Design Chopping Board with Non-Slip Feet & Deep Drip Juice Groove & Easy Grip Handle, 3 Size Thick Cutting Boards ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TQU5OoY1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CUTTING BOARDS FOR KITCHEN - This kitchen cutting board is made of PP+Wheat Straw +TPR material, so it will not warp, peel, crack, discolor or degrade, the use time is longer than wooden cutting board and bamboo cutting board. Four-layer thickened cutting board set includes 3 chopping boards of various sizes: \"L\" size is suitable for meat or steak, \"M\" size is suitable for vegetables, \"S\" size is suitable for fruit. Various sizes of cutting boards can meet your regular cutting needs. DOUBLE SIDE DESIGN - This cutting board set for kitchen counter has a double-sided design, The wood-grain surface is suitable for cutting fruits and vegetables, and the frosted surface is suitable for cutting meat and seafood. DEEP DRIP JUICE GROOVES & NON-SLIP FEET - Built-in deep drip juice grooves to capture excess liquid during food prep. No need to worry about meat, fruit, or vegetable juice running off the cutting board set with groove and onto your countertop when cutting. And silicone feet on the four sides can keep the cutting board with handle from slipping and moving. DISHWASHER SAFE - Non-porous, ultra-strong cutting surface is gentle on cutlery and knives and can be put in the dishwasher quickly. Dishwasher safe unlike many kinds of wood and bamboo boards, each cutting boards dishwasher safe has an easy-grip handle that you can hang the large cutting board and small cutting board on the wall. BEST CHOOSE FOR GIFT - This chopping board set arrive ready for use out of the box and it can be a great gift idea for Thanksgiving, Mother's Day, Father's Day, birthday, anniversary, and housewarming ceremony, or any special occasion. If for any reason you're not completely happy with your purchase, simply let us know and our friendly and reliable customer service will respond to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TQU5OoY1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoldFox","source_asin":"B0B12RRYTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B12RRYTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B12RRYTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":799611,"name":"BC Plaxidermy Wedding Unity Ceremony - Tie The Knot Board & Braid w/Ecclesiastes 4:12 Scripture and Personalized Names/Dates","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jKG+zcHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enough with unity candles and sand in a jar, This is a wedding unity board and braid made of hand selected white aspen with a natural multi layer clear coat finish, and two 4 inch pieces of stained Red Oak laying horizontally across the oak to give the piece a beautiful contrasted and rustic look. It is built for the couple to braid the three ropes together during the unity ceremony symbolizing the tie between God, the Bride & Groom. It is equipped with hanging capability on the back, this is a special moment in the life of the bride and groom, this way they are able to hang it on their wall to enjoy for the years ahead! These also make fantastic personalized wedding gifts for the happy newly weds!! The text of \"...A cord of three strands is not easily broken -Ecclesiastes 4:12\" is included with this piece. Also with this unit we are able to add in the Bride and Grooms name(s) along with the date of the wedding Please choose from option one, two or three for the style text you would like in either the Black or light creme colors (Creme is found on the example picture and is the most popular for the personalizations Things to pass on to the shop (Please send information to Seller BC Plaxidermy in private message, while you are purchasing in the cart, if you forget to send this information, our shop will reach out to you within 24 hrs 1) stain colors for the white aspen horizontal boards 2) text/font options 1, 2 or 3 3) Bride and Grooms Name(s)/wedding date 4) color of text/font (Black or Creme) ... And we will take care of the rest!! dimensions are 16inches x 28.5inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jKG+zcHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BC Plaxidermy","source_asin":"B06Y5G7H37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y5G7H37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y5G7H37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
