window.products.push({"id":799620,"name":"Personalized Dinosaur Towel for Kids - Custom Travel Beach Pool and Bath Towels for Adults Toddler Baby Boys Girls (Bath Towel 30\"x60\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GATagnCkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind towel for yourself or someone you love.  Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke.  Whatever you choose, we will take your text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less.  The top side is printed with the design you see in the example image, the back side is pure white. FUNCTIONALITY – No matter the size or design you choose, these towels will long be a treasured member of the family.  You can use them at the beach, in the bathroom, the kitchen, a golf course, the garage, anywhere you need the help of an absorbent friend.  These towels go where you go and perform all the duties expected of any top quality cloth. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size towels to choose from, there is something for everyone.  The smallest towel is the hand towel, 16”x28” and perfect for the kitchen, garage, and golf course.  The 30”x60” towel is best used in the bathroom.  The 35”x70” towel is ideal for days at the beach and pool, lounging around and drinking adult beverages. MACHINE WASHABLE – Nothing last forever, ESPECIALLY a clean towel.  One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok!  All towels are made from a 100% washable poly cotton blend, and the best part is the personalized design will never fade.  Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GATagnCkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07FQS3FTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FQS3FTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FQS3FTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
