window.products.push({"id":799708,"name":"Fanci Baking by Captivate Brands Cupcake Wrapper, one size, Country Floral","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zJDrLTZfL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Fanci brings color and fun to the kitchen with a nod towards the style of 1950’s England. Vintage meets modern with our stylish reinterpretation of days gone by, with a sensibility for today’s homes. The extensive product assortment covers all your needs to bake, take and share…Every Fanci item is not only gorgeous, but boasts a variety of features to help deliver delicious and professional results! The signature floral prints and details are featured throughout the collections. Clever teacup measuring cups, heavy oversized mixing bowls, durable non-stick bakeware and silicone tools are not only good looking in the kitchen, but pull double duty in the performance department. Fanci moves quickly from the kitchen to the top of the table, bringing equally exquisite style. The high quality ceramic pieces set the perfect mood for afternoon tea and cake. And, we offer fashionable storage solutions to keep your baked masterpieces fresh. You can even send your guests on their way, with an unexpected treat in one of our lovely paper storage solutions! Perfectly packaged with the Fanci signature rose print, the collection is ideal for gift giving all year round. Whether you enjoy the entire stylish range, or select a few of your favorites, you will always have options for perfect baking and serving. Have a little of what you Fanci every day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zJDrLTZfL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fanci Baking by Captivate Brands","source_asin":"B07B9QYGD3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B9QYGD3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B9QYGD3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
