window.products.push({"id":799748,"name":"USA Pan Bakeware Nonstick, Jelly Roll Pan with Lid, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512cmvVai5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The USA Pan jelly sheet pan with lid is made in the USA from globally sourced materials by a family owned and operated business. These baking pans provide home bakers with high quality and heavy duty tools to create memories and flawless homemade jellyroll cakes, cookies, rolls or french-fries for friends and family. It is also perfect for roasting vegetables and potatoes! The lid was specifically designed to fit the USA Pan jelly roll like a glove and come with a handle to allow for easy transport. Use the lid to store baked goods overnight or pop on top of the pan to make for flawless and safe movement from point A to point B (no crying over spilled milk here! ) The pans feature patented Americoat plus a silicone nonstick coating, which is PTFE, PFOA, and BPA free and promotes easy release for baked-goods and makes the pans easy to clean. USA Pan baking pans are uniquely designed with a fluted surface which facilitates air circulation and also maximizes pan strength and reduces warping. Every USA Pan is made in the USA from globally sourced materials and features a steel wire in the rim, which provides extra strength and further resistance to warping. The pans are built with performance features that commercial bakers enjoy, including heavy gauge aluminized Steel constructed to allow even heat distribution and maximum service life. USA Pan is a Bundy family owned company, based in the greater Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania area which has been producing high performance bakeware for over 50 years.  Use and Care: Do not exceed 450°F (230°C). Our bakeware conducts heat efficiently, which may require you to reduce the time and temperature as necessary. Hand wash bakeware in warm water with mild dishwashing soap using a sponge, rinse and dry thoroughly. Do not place in dishwasher. Follow recipe instructions, greasing and flouring as directed. Cooking spray is not recommended. To maintain the pan’s appearance over time, use a silicone baking mat or line the pan with aluminum foil when roasting vegetables or baking higher fat foods such as french fries or meat. Use only silicone, nylon or wooden utensils. Do not use sharp metal utensils.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512cmvVai5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USA Pan","source_asin":"B07F3TYF3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F3TYF3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F3TYF3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":799749,"name":"Swizzle Bottle Twist Top 6 Pack (16 Ounces)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71td0FgI1FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ THE BETTER SQUEEZE BOTTLES FOR PREP, COOKING & DECORATING - Whether you need bottles for filling your favorite oil, dressing, sauce, or syrup, this plastic squeeze bottle set preserves any liquid for your culinary projects. ★ NO LEAK LIDS - Each squeezable bottle comes with a twist-off, leak-proof lid , allowing you to open the cap and squeeze your desired sauce onto your food and then close it securely. Tips can be cut to different sizes for thicker sauces ★ PREMIUM QUALITY - Our bottles are made of food-grade polyethylene, a safe and secure material in which to store condiments, sauces or cooking oil. The plastic is resistant to chemical permeation, absorption of color or odor, and has an inner, non-stick coating. ★ CONVENIENT & VERSATILE - You can use these squeeze bottles for auto body repair and maintenance such as oil tune-up, polishes, glazes, and liquid wax. Alternatively, kids can use these bottles for storing spring-colored sand, liquid paints or handmade soap dyes for crafts and arts. ★ PRINTED MEASUREMENTS- If you need a bottle with measurements included, we've got you covered. Swizzle Bottles come with clearly printed measurements every 1/2 ounce.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71td0FgI1FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swizzle Bottles","source_asin":"B07BKPZQF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BKPZQF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BKPZQF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":799750,"name":"Halloween Pumpkins Window Light with Bat Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GhMkjbpnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Frightfully fun Halloween shimmer lighted window decoration, jack-o-lantern measures approximately 13 x 16 -Inch. Unique printed PVC material creates an eerie shimmering effect when back-lit. Ghosts, goblins and things that go \"bump\" in the night, wouldn't it be more fun if things went \"shimmering\" in the night. Since 1998, Impact Innovations Shimmer Lighted Window Decorations have created glowing holiday magic for young and old alike. Unlike many other lighted window decorations, Impact Innovations uses a unique printed PVC material that creates a supernatural shimmering effect when lit from behind by its 10 mini lights. From witches, skulls to ghosts and jack-o-lanterns, there're plenty of spooky Halloween themes from which to choose and whether it's Halloween, Thanksgiving or Christmas, you'll find a festive, fun and oh-so-shimmery lighted window decoration to add just the right touch of holiday magic of your own. All Impact Innovations Shimmer Lighted Window Decorations are UL approved, require no batteries or assembly and come with a handy suction cup for ease of hanging and suitable for indoor or protected outdoor use. Expertise in design and product innovation has made Impact Innovations the premier trendsetter in the seasonal decor industry. They invite you to discover their clever collections of Gel Window Clings, Vinyl Window Clings, Lighted Window Decorations, Red Velvet Flocked Bows and more, available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GhMkjbpnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impact Innovations","source_asin":"B07XFG3RZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XFG3RZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XFG3RZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
