window.products.push({"id":799868,"name":"ICOOL Mini Split Wall Mounting Bracket (22\" L x 19\" H) for 9,000-24,000 BTU Universal Ductless Air Conditioners Heat Pumps Compressors, Outdoor Heavy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UWavephzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compatible with most mini split air conditioners, adjustable for use with up to 9,000 - 24,000 BTU units (universal mini split, ductless air conditioner, heat pumps, AC compressors & HVAC systems), not exceeding a maximum weight capacity of 370 lbs. Safety-guaranteed, rust-proof, and durable. Our mini split brackets are made of high-quality heavy duty steel which is galvanized and epoxy painted. 8 rubber pads are offered to minimize the transmission of vibration from the unit to the bracket, optimize the safety and stability of mini split condensing unit installation. Please check to ensure clearance requirements are being met for your mini split unit. Keep your mini split elevated, protect from dirt, snow, debris, floods, vandalism, grass-clippings, etc. Great for all climates. This package contains all hardware, including 2x folded AC brackets, 4x small rubber pads, 4x big rubber pads, 4x short bolts with 8 flat washers and 4 nuts, 2x long bolts with 2 flat washers, 2 lock washers and 2 nuts, 4x concrete anchors. Breezy installation and versatility, assembly is easy enough. All necessary hardware included, please refer to our instructions provided. (If any accessories missing when you receive the wall mount air conditioner bracket, although it is a small probability event, please feel free to contact us at any time.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UWavephzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICOOL","source_asin":"B096ZJGFRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096ZJGFRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096ZJGFRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
