window.products.push({"id":799928,"name":"St Patricks Day Gnome Plush Elf for St Patricks Day Decorations Home Table Decor Ornament Dwarf Figurines St. Patrick's Day Gifts Green Irish Handmade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s3moB+k6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌈Gnome Symbol of Good Luck & Happiness - Two green shamrock gnomes welcome the arrival of St. Patrick's Day! As the home guardian from the folklore, gnomes will bring good luck to your family and let the coming days be full of warmth and happiness! 🌈St. Patrick's Day Decorations - In folklore, the gnome brings good luck to families and is regarded as good luck. It is perfect to decorate your tiered tray, desk, table, sofa, bookcase, shelf or a special place in your home. Let the whole house full of St.Patrick's Day/Saint Paddy's Day/Irish festive atmosphere. You also can give the stuffed gnomes to anyone as unique gifts. 🌈Premium Material - Each St Patrick’s gnome is handmade, using classy polyester and plush as its material to achieve the effect of soft, durable, and eco-friendly, which combines top-notch quality and novelty look ingeniously! 🌈St Patricks Day Gifts - Do you need a unique St.Patrick's Day gift? Your families or friends will be so surprised with these cute St Patricks Day gnomes. It makes a great gift and can be displayed anywhere in the home. you can easily take this lucky to your friends, family's, co-workers, neighbors, children. The adorable gnomes are the traditionalist and perfect for spreading the holiday spirit. 🌈A Must Have Decor For St.Patrick's Day - These gnome hanging ornaments are adorable St.Patrick's Day home decorations,popular to kids and adults,just enjoy your happy holiday with your family!and it's also a perfect gift for your friends,they will love it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s3moB+k6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teeker","source_asin":"B09QSDZTKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QSDZTKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QSDZTKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":799929,"name":"Karcassin 15 inch Wine Cooler Refrigerator – Update Version - Compressor Wine Bottle Chiller – Single Temp Zones – Stores upto 32 Bottles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81apbmHAOUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IDEAL BOTTLE CAPACITY — Wine chiller features beautiful interiors with 5 sliding beech wood shelves that accommodates up to 32 x 750 ml standard Bordeaux bottles (lesser capacity in case of 1-liter bottles), trendy blue LED lights that add a modern appeal, and a reversible door with security lock — BEST wine coolers! Now, don’t miss the sales at wine stores or an opportunity to buy a rare wine bottle during an international travel just because you don’t have enough storage space for wine. SMART TEMPERATURE CONTROL — With SINGLE TEMPERATURE ZONES and independently controllable temperatures (LCD DISPLAY & TOUCH CONTROL), our wine refrigerator allows you to set temperature between 41-64°F, while its memory function restores the temperature back to the set value in the event of a power loss. QUITE OPERATION & UNIFORM COOLING — Wine fridge is equipped with an ADVANCED COMPRESSOR which is specially designed to operate with low vibration to prevent disturbance of sediments, thereby enhancing the flavor and uniformly maturing the wine, while its special carbon filter with internal circulation stops bad smells and keep the air cool, fresh, and pure! The effective & controlled circulation of air using internal fan ensures that each bottle is kept at right temperature. DEDICATED WINE STORAGE — Not only does stocking your favourite wine with your day-old pasta and leftover salad not do it justice (as both have different temperature needs), but also spoils the flavour — store your collection in sleek and elegant stainless-steel finish Karcassin wine cooler refrigerator that will keep them crisp, cool, and ready to pour — FINEST compressor wine cooler! INTELLIGENTLY DESIGNED — Wine cooler fridge measures W15”x H32.9”x D22.6”and gives you the option to install it in a Cabinet for BUILT-IN storage or use it as a Standalone Unit. Moreover, DOUBLE LAYER GLASS for perfect cooling, and thoughtful KICK-PLATE DESIGN which allows lower part of wine cooler better align with the cabinet make it unbeatable. We provide 1- year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81apbmHAOUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Karcassin","source_asin":"B0833YQQ75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0833YQQ75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0833YQQ75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
