window.products.push({"id":799983,"name":"U-needQ Mini Travel Analog Alarm Clock, Non-Ticking - Battery Operated, Quartz Clock with 5 min Snooze- Loud Ascending Sound- Alarm Clocks with Night ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QAsaC6hrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Time Waits For No Man and Neither Does An Adventurer Whether you travel for business or pleasure, you probably have your ritual down. You know what you need, you know what to pack, you know where to cut corners and where not to. Any seasoned traveler knows that packing light is a must, whether you’re traveling to New York City or some remote mountain top. That’s why the UneedQ alarm clock for travelers is a great item to add to your list of must-haves. It requires only 1 AA battery and will last a long time. It’s incredibly lightweight, user friendly, and has a light which comes in handy when you’re in your tent or boat and need quick access to a light. It does some of the same things your cell phone does, allowing you to save battery life on your phone for more important things (which is particularly useful if you’re out camping or there’s a power shortage). With their ascending alarm feature, these wake up alarm clocks are great for all types of sleepers, including the hearing impaired. Color and Shape Variations: Black Gold Silver White Black (Square) Silver (Square) White (Square) Satisfaction Guaranteed If you aren’t totally happy with our product, we offer a 90-day full money back guarantee and a 1 year replacement guarantee on any broken or malfunctioning products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QAsaC6hrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-needQ","source_asin":"B076V98K95","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799983","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076V98K95","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076V98K95","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":799984,"name":"Hakoya Bento Box-akanezakura","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZkSH1JfeL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"In 1980, Fuji Merchandise Corporation was established in Los Angeles as a subsidiary of Fuji Merchandise, Inc. in Yokohama, Japan. As an importer of quality products from Japan, our core product-line back then was lacquer-ware from the Shizuoka region, wholesaling primarily to small gift shops in the Los Angeles and San Francisco area. Our product-line has since evolved to include porcelain tableware, kitchen products, cast iron teapots, premium Japanese green tea, paper products, kimonos, professional grade knives, Japanese decorative products, Japanese giftware items, and a wide array of products for the restaurant supply industry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZkSH1JfeL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hakoya","source_asin":"B00HQ6JHDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-799984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HQ6JHDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HQ6JHDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
